cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the measurements or data snapshots in this repository, please
  cite it as below and include the snapshot dates of the figures you use.
title: "Ascend OSS Engineering Activity"
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: "Jin Chian"
    family-names: "Seer"
    affiliation: "Research Institute for Democracy, Society, and Emerging Technology (DSET)"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-7116-0449"
repository-code: "https://github.com/seer001/ascend-oss-activity"
version: "1.0.0"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
date-released: "2026-08-21"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible measurements of publicly visible engineering activity around
  Huawei Ascend and CANN: a fixed-window calibration of Lennart Heim's 2026
  GitHub commit counts, an extension to three CANN operator repositories on
  GitCode, and a classified set of Kimi K3 launch-window support pull
  requests with dated status snapshots. Code is MIT-licensed; analysis text
  and data snapshots are CC BY 4.0.
